  "description": "Effy shared web runtime + console chrome \u2014 config, Amplify wiring, the passwordless email one-time code flow, session guard, server-state client, telemetry, client store, and the SPA shell. Audience-neutral: every web surface consumes it, none re-implements it (constitution Principle II). Exports TS source.",
